5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see you all. I hope we can find a plan that is steady and kind to everyone, regardless of the season.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I am particularly concerned with how our physical locations and hours might inadvertently exclude some of our neighbors.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should look at what we did before! Why do we always guess when there are old records we can just read?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A rational approach indeed, Rin. I suspect our issues are less about the amount of money and more about the architecture of our funding.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must ensure that any expansion is realistic. It is not enough to have a plan; we need the specific skills on staff to execute it.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a very good point. I worry that we often rely on things we cannot control, which leads to disappointment.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I wonder if the current bus links are the primary barrier for those in the outer wards.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! And maybe someone tried a bus thing years ago and it failed. We should check the old programs!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. I would be curious to see if our endowment terms are as flexible as we imagine them to be.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. I want to see who is actually on our roster and if they have the training required for new responsibilities.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the road closures and the bus links. I want to be sure our services don't vanish when the snow falls.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will examine the bus links as well, and the evening room bookings to see when people actually need us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to find those two programs from six years ago and the old outreach attendance sheets! I bet they have secrets!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I will investigate the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I will check the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
